//Lock & Log Files
// Runtime locks only — package manager lock files are re-included below.
**/*.lock
!**/Cargo.lock
!**/package-lock.json
!**/pnpm-lock.yaml
!**/yarn.lock
!**/composer.lock
!**/poetry.lock
!**/go.sum
!**/flake.lock
**/*.log
**/*.log.*
**/nohup.out

//Build Artifacts & Language Output
// NOTE: dist/ build/ bin/ obj/ out/ are generic names — drop any line here if
// your project ships content from a folder with that name.
**/target/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.class
**/*.o
**/*.obj
**/*.pdb
**/*.ilk
**/*.dSYM/
